            "heading": "How long does printing take?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your book is made for you, printed on demand. Add the estimated production time below to the shipping time above for an estimated delivery date:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>USA</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>Canada</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: 2-3 business days</li><li><strong>Australia</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>New Zealand</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>EU</strong>: 4-5 business days</li><li><strong>Rest of the World</strong>:&nbsp;2-5 business days</li></ul>",
