        "custom_liquid": "<!-- Picco Puppy cart page testimonials: paste into a Custom Liquid section on the cart page. -->\n<style>\n.pp-t{--ink:#121212;--mut:rgba(18,18,18,.6);--body:rgba(18,18,18,.75);--cream:#ffffff;--card:#fff;--coral:#e4684f;--gold:#f0b94d;--line:#eadfce;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:Assistant,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--body);padding:56px max(15px,calc((100vw - 1170px)/2)) 64px;width:100vw;max-width:100vw;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{overflow-x:clip}\n.pp-t *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.pp-t h1,.pp-t h2,.pp-t h3{font-family:inherit;color:var(--ink);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.6px;line-height:1.4;margin:0}\n.pp-t-hero{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto 48px;text-align:center}\n.pp-t-eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin:0 0 14px;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fbe3dc;color:#b8432c;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.pp-t h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:14px}\n.pp-t-sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--mut);margin:0 auto 36px;max-width:620px}\n.pp-t-feature{position:relative;margin:0;text-align:left;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:44px 40px 32px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(60,40,10,.08)}\n.pp-t-feature:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:8px;border-radius:22px 0 0 22px;background:linear-gradient(var(--coral),var(--gold))}\n.pp-t-bigq{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:28px;font:400 120px/1 Assistant,sans-serif;color:#f6d9cf}\n.pp-t-feature h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative}\n.pp-t-feature .pp-t-body p{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px;position:relative}\n.pp-t-feature figcaption{margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 10px;align-items:baseline;font-size:15px}\n.pp-t-feature figcaption span,.pp-t-card footer span{color:var(--mut)}\n.pp-t-grid{max-width:none;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:22px;align-items:start}\n.pp-t-grid.pp-t-js{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start}\n.pp-t-col{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}\n.pp-t-card{position:relative;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px 26px 22px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(60,40,10,.05);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n.pp-t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(60,40,10,.1)}\n.pp-t-qm{position:absolute;top:2px;left:18px;font:400 64px/1 Assistant,sans-serif;color:#f6d9cf}\n.pp-t-card h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin:14px 0 10px;position:relative}\n.pp-t-body p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}\n.pp-t-card footer{margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;align-items:baseline;font-size:14px}\n.pp-t-chip{margin-left:auto;background:#e6f2ec;color:#2d6a4f;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}\n.pp-t-band{max-width:none;margin:56px auto 0}\n.pp-t-band h2{font-size:28px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px}\n.pp-t-qs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px}\n.pp-t-q{margin:0;background:#fff3df;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 22px 18px}\n.pp-t-q blockquote{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;font-style:normal}\n.pp-t-q figcaption{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#b8432c}\n.pp-t-q figcaption span{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-size:14px;color:var(--mut)}\n.pp-t-sv{background:#e9eefb}.pp-t-sv figcaption{color:#3b4a8a}\n.pp-t-cta{max-width:760px;margin:64px auto 0;text-align:center;background:#121212;color:#fff;border-radius:0;padding:48px 28px}\n.pp-t-cta h2{color:#fff;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.pp-t-cta p{margin:0 auto 24px;max-width:520px;color:#e6e6e6;font-size:16px}\n.pp-t-btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center}\n.pp-t-btn{display:inline-block;border-radius:0;background:#fff;color:#121212!important;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:15px;line-height:47px;padding:0 30px}\n.pp-t-btn:hover{background:#e6e6e6}\n.pp-t-ghost{background:transparent;border:2px solid #fff}.pp-t-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.pp-t .pp-t-note{margin:28px auto 0;font-size:13px;color:#aab1cf}\n@media(min-width:750px){.pp-t{padding-left:max(50px,calc((100vw - 1100px)/2));padding-right:max(50px,calc((100vw - 1100px)/2))}}\n@media(max-width:749px){.pp-t h1{font-size:28px}.pp-t-band h2,.pp-t-cta h2{font-size:20px}.pp-t-feature h2{font-size:20px}}\n@media(max-width:640px){.pp-t{padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:48px}.pp-t-feature{padding:36px 22px 24px}.pp-t-feature .pp-t-body p{font-size:17px}}\n\n.pp-t-card h3 { font-weight: 700 !important; }\n.pp-t.pp-t-cart{padding-top:32px;padding-bottom:40px}\n.pp-t-cart .pp-t-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px;align-items:stretch;max-width:none;margin:0 auto}\n.pp-t-cart .pp-t-card.pp-t-notitle .pp-t-body{margin-top:50px}\n.pp-t-cart .pp-t-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.pp-t-cart .pp-t-card footer{margin-top:auto}\n@media(max-width:749px){.pp-t-cart .pp-t-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pp-t-cart .pp-t-card footer{margin-top:16px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"pp-t pp-t-cart\">\n  <section class=\"pp-t-grid\" aria-label=\"Customer testimonials\">\n<article class=\"pp-t-card\"><div class=\"pp-t-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</div><h3>Amazing and beautiful book</h3><div class=\"pp-t-body\"><p>This book is absolutely beautiful. I am obsessed with it. I teared up the first time I read it!! The illustrations are stunning too!! Such a good book to have for your children!!!</p></div><footer><strong>Allee</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer></article>\n<article class=\"pp-t-card\"><div class=\"pp-t-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</div><h3>Quality is amazing!</h3><div class=\"pp-t-body\"><p>I received my books today and I was absolutely blown away by just how beautiful they are! The quality is amazing!</p></div><footer><strong>Lauren Taylor</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer></article>\n<article class=\"pp-t-card\"><div class=\"pp-t-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</div><h3>Very satisfied</h3><div class=\"pp-t-body\"><p>I was kept updated all through the ordering process. I am very satisfied with my purchase.</p></div><footer><strong>Diane Hetzer</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer></article>\n  </section>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
